{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of opportunities to make money. But the most usual one is to: <br>-Accept orders from your tablet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Go to the designated area</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Deliver the desired order to the designated customer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Make small interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Care your vehicle and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Keep your eye out about any kind of individuals at night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to drive carefully to not damage your orders. Don't forget the items you need to bring, otherwise the customers will give you low rating or no tips. If you behave the rules, you're gonna get rewarded really well.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2188700?t=1756505752","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2188700?t=1756505752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188700/1220c2d5b82a594036d177cda188b7f4239d0e83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756505752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188700/1220c2d5b82a594036d177cda188b7f4239d0e83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756505752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lots of opportunities to make money. But the most usual one is to: <br>-Accept orders from your tablet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Go to the designated area</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Deliver the desired order to the designated customer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Make small interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Care your vehicle and have fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Keep your eye out about any kind of individuals at night</p><p cla